        "original_id": "bef56173-bbda-50df-8011-2c1954f250f0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Cold North Killers: Canadian Serial Murder\n- People: Edward H. Rulloff, Russell Williams\n- Places: CFB Trenton, Canada\n- Roles: commander of CFB Trenton\n\nFacts:\n- Cold North Killers: Canadian Serial Murder documents the lives of sixty Canadian serial killers.\n- In Cold North Killers: Canadian Serial Murder, Edward H. Rulloff is the earliest Canadian serial killer covered, and Russell Williams is the most recent.\n- From July 2009 until his arrest in February 2010, Russell Williams commanded CFB Trenton.\n- CFB Trenton is Canada's largest military airbase and a hub for air transport operations in Canada and abroad.",
